 "input": "claims team process for home insurance. customer reports the claim by phone or the web form, we create a claim record against their policy. handler checks cover against the policy wording and excess. small claims get settled straight away, bigger ones get a loss adjuster who visits and writes a report. fraud screening runs on every new claim record automatically. settlement: cash payment or we send a repairer from our approved network. customer can complain, and if we don't resolve it in 8 weeks they can go to the ombudsman. reserves for open claims are set by the handler for finance.",
